2026-07-29T15:33:17.1196183Z +     "NOT run on CRAN. They run automatically on GitHub Actions (including\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.1197492Z +     "r-universe). This keeps check time and resource usage on CRAN within\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.1199097Z +     "acceptable limits and helps release duckdb in a predictable and controlled\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.1199926Z +     "manner.\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.1200319Z +     "\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.1203075Z +     "This is intentional, not an oversight. duckdb has an extensive test suite\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.1204511Z +     "that runs continuously in our own CI; see <https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb-r>.\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.1205316Z +     "\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.1206045Z +     "To run the test suite locally, set the environment variable before checking:\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.1207071Z +     "  Sys.setenv(DUCKDB_R_RUN_TESTS = \"true\")    # from within R, or\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.1208161Z +     "  DUCKDB_R_RUN_TESTS=true R CMD check ...      # from the shell\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.1209309Z +     strrep("=", 78),
2026-07-29T15:33:17.1209729Z +     "\n"
2026-07-29T15:33:17.1210102Z +   )
2026-07-29T15:33:17.1210855Z + }
