2026-07-29T15:33:17.3101015Z +     strrep("=", 78),
2026-07-29T15:33:17.3101140Z +     "\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.3101367Z +     "Skipping the duckdb test suite.\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.3101646Z +     "\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.3102117Z +     "The duckdb tests exercise DuckDB's bundled C++ engine and are deliberately\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.3102533Z +     "NOT run on CRAN. They run automatically on GitHub Actions (including\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.3103972Z +     "r-universe). This keeps check time and resource usage on CRAN within\n",
2026-07-29T15:33:17.3104548Z +     "acceptable limits and helps release duckdb in a predictable and controlled\n",
